"
I am raised when the carp server misbehaves at the protocol level: it cannot
be reached or spawned, or it answers a malformed or error response. Cell-level
compile failures are NOT me; they come back as a failed
{{gtClass:name=CarpEvalResult}}.
"
Class {
	#name : #CarpServerError,
	#superclass : #Error,
	#category : #'Carp-Server'
}
